# r1124w7: respawn the capture client's player after a death screen (CQ-CPP-01 left it in the ground)
## CQ-W7-RESPAWN | respawn and reset the client player
do {"click_widget": "Respawn"}
do {"wait": 40}
> gamemode creative @s
> tp @s 0 -60 0
do {"screen": "inventory"}
do {"wait": 10}
do {"screen": "close"}
